        },
        {
          "text": "Kikikïlekïtit asispa pipö Yaudi nyo wow nyo pö Pasaka,* kïpkana pich cho chang kestonikwa kutang Yerusalem, atökïtuyechï wölini ompö tuyo kitïlilöto kegh kïtomö kwitïta asisoni wow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
